    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n93474" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σᾰφην-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make clear</i> or <i>plain</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦτο δὴ σαφηνιῶ</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				227
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				621
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξιστορήσας καὶ σαφηνίσας ὁδόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ch.</u>
					678
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τοὺς κρατιστεύοντας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					8.4.5
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν παιδείαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Lac.</u>
					2.1
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Mem.</u>
				4.3.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				4.7.6
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τὴν βασιλείαν</span>
			<i>determine</i> the succession, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				8.7.9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> abs.,
				<i>articulate clearly</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Carn.</u>
				18
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ φωνῇ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					633a12
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Pr.</u>
				888b10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				902a6
			</span></i>.</div>
